    "kicker": "Enforcement planes",
    "description": "A shared axis runs edit, commit, push, pull request, merge. Git hooks cover commit and push and act at commit. The session git-guard covers edit to push and acts at push. CI covers push and pull request and acts at the pull request. Remote branch protection covers pull request and merge, acts at merge, and is the only plane drawn with an end cap, meaning remote and required. One change crosses all four planes in that order.",
    "caption": "Local planes give fast feedback and can be edited, and only the remote plane at merge is a boundary.",
